<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">- Tsishingini (tsw)</book>
  <para style="h">Zakariya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zakariya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zakariya</para>
  <para style="mt2">Zakariya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Zakariya</para>
  <para style="is">Ucuɗuwu wa aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="ip">Zakariya ta̱ aɗa a sa'ani ba̱ta̱ re. Aɗa o ufaru a̱ɗiva̱ a nyan a̱ tyo kunla̱ (1-8) a ta a ɗa a adanshi e ikaka ya̱ a̱bunda̱ a Zakariya vumava̱sula̱ diga a mantsa koko'o diga a'wan ukpaku uton nu ushin 520 a̱ tyo ukpaku uton na̱ kupa na̱ kunla̱ 518 kafu limatan va̱ Yesu. Adanshi e ikaka'a a ta a aci alavu alavu, aza a na a̱ ri adanshi o usuwisa u lyuci gbain va̱ Urishelima, na̱ matawa ma akiza ma ama a̱ A̱sula̱, na̱ mantsa ma zamawawa ma na ma̱ ri lo a̱ ta̱wa̱.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aɗa e ire diga a̱ɗiva̱ a̱ kucci a̱ tyo kupa na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi (9-14) o ɓoloto ta̱ nlingata adama a zamawawa na a̱ ri e ipiri i na wa̱a̱ ta̱wa̱, oɓolo nu uge'etosu wu ukosu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Cu'un vi ikaka i na A̱sulazuva a cayi Zakariya a̱yi ɗa a gura revetyo ama a̱ yi ana, na amayun u to shiton nzuwulai ma̱ yi, ko na wo o'woi babu mogono o ugundo wo Mogono Da̱wuda, waru babu A̱a̱'isa̱mapaɗa. Na̱ ne suru ama'a a̱ ri a̱bunda̱ shi waru a̱ ri nu ucira shi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ili i na i ri pe a̱tsuma̱ a aatagada a nda</para>
  <para style="io">Ikaka i morono ma atsuvu oɓolo na̱ mazuwa mo okolo 1.1; 8:23</para>
  <para style="io">Oforo adama o nron mu nden ma Isra'ila 9:1-8</para>
  <para style="io">Utsuru na̱ nden ma asuvu nna n ri elime 9:9 14:21.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1" />
  <para style="s">Ɗewu a̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1" />A̱tsuma̱ o woto wa̱ kunla̱, a̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan e ire a Dariyu, adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ ya Zakariya vumava̱sula̱, ulobo wa Berekiya ulobo wa Ido, adansa,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:24">Ezr 4:24</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 5:1">5:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 6">6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2" />&lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva a̱ shi ta̱ a yuwusan upan lon na̱ nkaya n ɗu. <verse eid="ZEC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3" />Adama o ndolo vu damma le, apa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;Ni i ka̱mba̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱, a̱mu fo n ta̱ ka̱mba̱ ya̱'a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4" />She yo o'wo tsu nkaya n ɗu wan, aza a na ama̱sula̱ o ufaru a yuwayin adanshi, vadalai o ure wi iwuya i ɗu ni iwuya i na yaa yuwusan. Na̱ ne suru a uwwa shi agba o poloo mu atsuvu shi,&gt; &gt;&gt; ne ɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5" />&lt;&lt;Te gba nkaya nɗu n ri gogo? Oɓolo na ama̱sula̱, a̱ ta̱ lo wuma hali hali hali? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6" />Amma adanshi a̱ va̱ na̱ re va̱ gba, aza a na n zuwai agbashi a̱ va̱ ama̱sula̱, a fara na̱ nkaya n ɗu shi? Ɗaɗa a vadalai a̱vu a damma, &lt;A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a yuwan ta̱ na̱ a̱tsu o una̱ u wuma u tsu ni ili i na tsaa yuwusan, cine u zuwai waa yuwan.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alavu alavu e ido i na Zakariya e enei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7" />O urana wu ushin na̱ a̱za̱ a̱ na̱shi o woto wa kupa na̱ za ta̱, woto wa Sheba, a̱tsuma̱ a aa'wan e ire o mogono Dariyu, adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ ya Zakariya vumava̱sula̱ ulobo wa Berekiya ulobo wa Ido.<verse eid="ZEC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8" />A̱tsuma̱ a ayin me ene ta̱ alavu alavu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:28">Juw 2:28</ref>.</char></note> malingata ma̱ A̱sula̱ ukumbu o do shili! U shi ta̱ mishin a̱ memere ma ɗanga murtil o uka̱ri u ke'en. A̱ca̱pa̱ a̱ yi do shili na̱ do da̱n da̱n na̱ do uri shi ta̱ lo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:2-8">Wen 6:2-8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9" />A̱vu me ece malingata ma̱ A̱sula̱'a̱, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa nda'a zagbain va̱?&gt;&gt; A̱vu malingata ma na maa yuwusan adanshi na̱ a̱mu'u u usu, &lt;&lt;N to roco wu ko nye i ɗa nda'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10" />Reve vuma na ri mishin a̱ memere ma ɗanga murtil'i u usu, &lt;&lt;Ele nda ele ɗa aza a na A̱sulazuva a̱ lyunguyi a bura uvaɗi ma̱ɓula̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11" />Reve a̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva ma na ma̱ ri mishin a̱tsuma̱ a ɗanga murtil'i, a damma, &lt;&lt;Tsu bura ta̱ uvaɗi ma̱ɓula̱, reve gba a̱yi ɗa nda, uvaɗi'i suru u ta̱ nden gbaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12" />Reve malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva'a ma damma, &lt;&lt;A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, hali a̱ tyo mantsa ma̱ ne vaa 'yuwan o roco Urishelima isa'ani ni ilyuci ya Yahuda, aza a na vu ri o upan ne ele hali a'wan kupocindere a nda?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13" />Ɗaɗa A̱sulazuva a̱ usuyi malingata ma na maa yuwusan adanshi na̱ a̱mu'u na adanshi e isa'ani nu uda̱na̱tosu wo okolo. <verse eid="ZEC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14" />Ɗaɗa malingata ma na maa yuwusan adanshi na̱ a̱mu ma dammai, &lt;&lt;Saala, apa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;N ta̱ a̱ tsushu'un tsa̱ Urishelima lon na̱ Sihiyona. <verse eid="ZEC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15" />Agba n ta̱ o upan lon na̱ nɗa n na n ri nden gbaga. N shi ta̱ n yuwan upan ke'en na ama a̱ va̱, amma reve nɗa'a n ca le a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a na a la'ai ucira lon.&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16" />Adama o ndolo, apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;N ta̱ ka̱mba̱ uba̱ta̱ wa̱ Urishelima ni isa'ani, waru ɗe ɗa a suwisa u'wa u va̱, ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. Waru a̱ ta̱ ba̱ruwa̱ amunga o uritosu wu usaa wa̱ Urishelima.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17" />Saalisa waru, &lt;&lt;Apa ili na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;Ilyuci i va̱ waru i ta̱ da̱shi shiwan nu ulyuwu we elime, waru A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱to Sihiyona okolo reve u ɗangwisa Urishelima.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alavu alavu a avana na aruma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18" />Reve n ka̱lyuwa̱ zuva ɗaɗa me enei avana a̱ na̱shi! <verse eid="ZEC 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19" />Ɗaɗa n dammai malingata ma na ma yuwain adanshi na̱ a̱mu'u, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa nda'a?&gt;&gt; A̱vu u usu mu, &lt;&lt;Ele nda ele ɗa avana a na e bete'wei Yahuda na̱ Isra'ila na̱ Urishelima.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20" />Reve A̱sulazuva o roco mu aruma a̱ na̱shi. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21" />Reve me ece, &lt;&lt;Nye a̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ a yuwan?&gt;&gt; A̱vu u usu, &lt;&lt;Ele ɗa avana a na e bete'wei Yahuda adama ko za gura 'ya̱sa̱n aaci a̱ yi wan. Amma aruma o ndolo a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ adama a ca le wovon, reve oo oco avana a nɗa n na n 'ya̱sa̱in avana e le a̱ nla̱ngi ni iɗa ya Yahuda adama e bete'we yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2" />
  <para style="s">Vuma na ri na amunga o uritosu wu usaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1" />A mantsa ma na n 'ya̱sa̱in esu a̱ va̱, reve me ene vuma ro na amunga o uritosu wu usaa o ukere wa̱ yi. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2" />Reve me ece, &lt;&lt;Te va̱ 'ya̱wa̱?&gt;&gt; A̱vu u usu, &lt;&lt;N ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ n rito Urishelima, tsa̱ra̱ n reve washin wa̱ yi nu uga'an wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3" />A mantsa ma na malingata ma na ma̱ da̱na̱i a yuwusan adanshi na̱ a̱mu ma̱ ka̱ra̱i, reve malingata mo ro mo uta̱ tsa̱ra̱ u ga'an na̱ a̱yi. <verse eid="ZEC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4" />A̱vu malingata'a ma damma malingata ma na n da̱na̱i oɓolo na̱ a̱yi'i, &lt;&lt;Suma vu damma ulobo u ndeɗe, &lt;Urana u ro Urishelima to o'wo tse ilyuci i na i ri na̱ ɓaɓu shi, adama a̱ a̱bunda̱ a ama ni iliyamunga a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi. <verse eid="ZEC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5" />Reve a̱mu na aciya̱va̱ mo o'wo yi uɓaɓu wa akina a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱,&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai, &lt;reve moo o'wo yi tsugbain pe e memere ma̱ yi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɗewu va aza a tsugbashi a̱ ka̱mba̱ o u'wa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6" />&lt;&lt;Uta̱i! Uta̱i! Sumai i lyawa iɗa yu ugana, adama a na m bete'we ɗu ta̱ a̱ tyo a pasu na̱shi va zuva,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="ZEC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7" />&lt;&lt;Uta̱i! A̱ɗu ama a Sihiyona! Sumai, a̱ɗu na i ri nden e ilyuci ya Babila!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8" />Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;Adama a tsugbain tsa̱ yi u lyungu mu ta̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a nɗa n na m pura̱i itana i ɗu, adama a na za na suru ju'wa̱n nɗu u ju'wa̱n ta̱ mawun ma̱ lyusu ma̱ va̱. <verse eid="ZEC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9" />Uwwai nda, n ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n ukere u va̱ nla̱ngi ne ele, reve agbashi e le a̱ pura̱ itana i le.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa yee reve a na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa a̱ lyungu numu. <verse eid="ZEC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10" />&lt;&lt;Cana ishipa vu yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱, a̱vu Usheli wa̱ Sihiyona, adama a na a̱yi ɗa nda, n ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱ a̱vu n da̱nu e memere ma̱ ɗu,&gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="ZEC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11" />O urana u ndolo nɗa na̱ a̱bunda̱ o to ɓolo aci na̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu o o'wo ama a̱ yi. U ta̱ da̱nu e memere me le, ɗaɗa yee reve a na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa a̱ lyungu numu ya̱'a̱ ɗu. <verse eid="ZEC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12" />A̱sulazuva o to o'wo na̱ Yahuda tsa agadu a̱ yi iɗa ya akiza, reve waru u ɗangwisa Urishelima. <verse eid="ZEC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13" />Rungwa̱ yi kpen a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ɗu ama suru, adama a na u 'yon ta̱ mishin uba̱ta̱ wu nden wa akiza a̱ yi.<verse eid="ZEC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3" />
  <para style="s">A̱tugu a akiza adama a ganu gbain</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1" />Reve A̱sulazuva o roco mu Josuwa ganu gbain mishin a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva, na̱ Mekerenkesu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mekerenkesu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Urevu wu danshi nda a̱ yi ɗa za na tsu 'ya̱wa̱ na adanshi a aci a za ro.</char></note> mishin a̱ mɓa̱nga̱ mu ukere u sa'ani wa̱ yi adama u 'ya̱wa̱ na adanshi a aci a̱ Josuwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:2">Ezr 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:10">Wen 12:10</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ZEC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma Mekerenkesu'u, &lt;&lt;Lyawa A̱sulazuva a ɓara wu, Mekerenkesu! A̱sulazuva za na ɗangwai Urishelima ɓara wu! Vuma nda'a u ta̱ tsa aɗanga a na a usai diga a̱tsuma̱ a akina.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3" />Josuwa da̱na̱ ta̱ wotowu na̱ a̱tugu e idaba mishin a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma malingata'a. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4" />Reve malingata'a ma damma aza a na a̱ ri mishin a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ yi, &lt;&lt;Foɗo niyi a̱tugu e idaba'a.&gt;&gt; Reve u damma Josuwa, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱ nda, n tawa ta̱ unusu wa̱ wu, agba n to oto wu itana i cece.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5" />Reve n damma, &lt;&lt;Lyawa o oto yi ookokolo e cece a aaci a̱ yi.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa o oto niyi ookokolo e cece a aaci'i, a̱vu fo o oto yi itana'a, malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva'a gba lo mishin zuzu. <verse eid="ZEC 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6" />Reve malingata'a ma yuwaan Josuwa tsuɓari u damma, <verse eid="ZEC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7" />&lt;&lt;Apa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;Na̱ vaa yuwan mmalu o ure u va̱ a̱vu vu guza̱ tsuɓari tsa̱ va̱, ɗaɗa vaa yuwan tsugbain tsu u'wa u va̱, reve waru vu ka̱lyuwa̱ ukowo u va̱, waru n ta ca wu uba̱ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a ama a nda a na a̱ ri mishin pa. <verse eid="ZEC 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8" />Uwwa nda, a̱vu Josuwa ganu gbain, a̱vu na̱ n'utsa̱ ma̱ wu n na n ri nden a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ wu, adama a na ele iroci i ɗa yi ili i na ya̱a̱ ta̱wa̱, n ta̱ ka̱mbuwa̱ aagbashi a̱ va̱, ete'en. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9" />A̱yi ɗa nda n zuwai aatali a nda a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma̱ Josuwa, aatali a na a̱ ri na̱ pasu cindere, n ta yuwan iɗana zuva va̱ yi, waru n ta tawa unusu wa ama nda urana u ta̱,&gt; &gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. <verse eid="ZEC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10" />&lt;&lt;O urana u ndolo, koyan a̱tsuma̱ a̱ ɗu u ta banu moron ma̱ nden ma̱ yi u ta̱wa̱ u da̱nu za̱la̱ va ataci a ina̱bi va̱ yi nu uɗanga wu ubiri wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai.<verse eid="ZEC 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4" />
  <para style="s">Alavu alavu a wisawatan u fitila u zinariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1" />Reve malingata ma na ma yuwain adanshi na̱ a̱mu ma̱ ta̱wisa̱ reve u jisan mu, cine a tsu jisan vuma a̱tsuma̱ a nlavu ma̱ yi. <verse eid="ZEC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2" />Reve we ece mu, &lt;&lt;Nye vee inda?&gt;&gt; Reve n usu, &lt;&lt;N te inda wisawatan u fitila u zinariya, na̱ mataɗa ma mani'in a aaci a̱ yi, ni ifitila i cindere ɗe, ni ilogoni i cindere ɗe. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3" />Waru na̱ ɗanga zetun re e eɓele a̱ yi, za ta̱ e eɓele o usa'ani u mataɗa'a za ta̱ waru e eɓele o ugula̱ wa̱ yi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4" />Reve n damma malingata ma na ma yuwain adanshi na̱ a̱mu'u, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa nda'a, zagbain va̱?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5" />Reve u usu mu, &lt;&lt;Vu reve ili i nda'a shi?&gt;&gt; A̱vu n usu, &lt;&lt;O'o, zagbain va̱,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6" />Ɗaɗa u damma numu, &lt;&lt;A̱yi nda adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa a̱ tyo ya Zerubabe, &lt;Nu ucira u ɗa shi ko nu ukadu shi, amma na̱ Ruhu va̱,&gt; &gt;&gt; A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa a dammai ne. <verse eid="ZEC 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7" />&lt;&lt;Zane ɗa vu ri a̱vu masasan ma gbain? A̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma Zerubabe vu to o'wo iɗa kpasa kpasa. Reve wu uta̱a̱ atali a sa'ani diga o mogogolo, reve ama e teme yisali adansa, &lt;Ulobono ta̱, ulobono ta̱!&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8" />Reve adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱ a dansa, <verse eid="ZEC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9" />&lt;&lt;Ekere a Zerubabe a ɗa a varai ikyun ya̱ A̱a̱'isa̱ a nda, ekere a̱ yi a ɗa waru oo gono yi.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa yee reve a na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱ lyungu mu ta̱ ya̱'a̱ ɗu.<verse eid="ZEC 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10" />&lt;&lt;Adama a na za na suru tarai urana wi ili i keke'en ili i ro shi, o to zo'oso a mantsa ma na e enei amunga o ritosu wu usaa o ukere wa Zerubabe. &lt;Ifitila i cindere a nda iroci ya̱ esu a̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa, aza a na a̱ ri agara a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi suru.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11" />Reve me ece malingata ma̱ A̱sula̱'a̱, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa ɗanga zetun re nda'a na ri o ukere u sa'ani nu ugula̱ u wisawatan u fitila'a?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12" />A̱vu waru me ece yi, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa eten e re a ɗanga zetu'un, a na a̱ ri zuzu na abulu a zinariya e re a na o utosu mani'in ma zinariya'a?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13" />A̱vu u usu mu, &lt;&lt;Vu reve ili i nda'a shi?&gt;&gt; A̱vu n usu, &lt;&lt;O'o, zagbain va̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14" />Ɗaɗa u dammai, &lt;&lt;Ele ɗa ama e re a na a tawai a na ee isawusan uba̱ta̱ wu zagbain vu uvaɗi suru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 4:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5" />
  <para style="s">Alavu alavu a aatagada a tsu'yan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1" />Reve n ka̱lyuwisa̱ a̱vu me ene aatagada a tsu'yan! <verse eid="ZEC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2" />Reve malingata me ece mu, &lt;&lt;Nye ve enei?&gt;&gt; A̱vu n usu, &lt;&lt;Me ene ta̱ aatagada a tsu'yan, uga'an wa̱ yi ana mata'tsu washin waru ana kupa no ozo o ton.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3" />Reve malingata'a u damma mu, &lt;&lt;A̱yi ɗa una̱ u na u ri agara a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a suru, adama a na ili i na u dammai e eɓele a̱ ta̱, za na suru yuwain wivu a̱ ta̱ gba̱ra̱ yi, waru e ili i na waa dansa e eɓele a̱ ndeɗe, za na suru kucinai ne epen a̱ ta̱ gba̱ra̱ yi. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4" />N ta̱ lyungu aatagada'a o uta̱, waru u ta uwa o u'wa u vivu, no u'wa wu za na kucinai na aala a̱ va̱ ne epen. U ta̱ da̱na̱ pe o u'wa wa̱ yi reve u kototo yi, na akpata a̱ yi oɓolo na atali a̱ yi.&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai.<verse eid="ZEC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alavu alavu a ka a̱tsuma̱ a Aasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5" />Reve malingata ma na ma yuwain adanshi na̱ a̱mu'u mo uta̱ reve u damma, &lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwa̱ zuva ve ene ili i nda i na i ri o uta̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6" />Reve me ece, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa nda'a?&gt;&gt; A̱vu u usu, &lt;&lt;Aasaka o ukunzusu u ɗa.&gt;&gt; A̱vu u dammisa, &lt;&lt;A̱yi ɗa iwuya ya ama a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a ma̱ɓula̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7" />Reve gba, ana a̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱i ikpa̱ta̱tsu ya aasaka'a, a̱vu gba me eneshi ka pe nden a aasaka'a! <verse eid="ZEC 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8" />A̱vu u damma, &lt;&lt;A̱yi nda iwuya i ɗa,&gt;&gt; a̱vu u ca̱co yi pe a aasaka'a, reve u kpa̱to ikpa̱ta̱tsu'u a̱ ka̱mba̱ o una̱ wa̱ yi. <verse eid="ZEC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9" />Reve n ka̱lyuwa̱ zuva reve gba me ene a̱yi ɗa nda, a̱ma̱ci e re a̱ ta̱wa̱ nu upepu e evelu e le. A̱ shi ta̱ ne evelu tsa aza a aashamuwa, reve a̱ 'ya̱sa̱n aasaka'a zuva e memere mo uvaɗi na̱ zuva. <verse eid="ZEC 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10" />A̱vu me ece malingata ma na ma̱ shi a adanshi na̱ a̱mu'u, &lt;&lt;Te ɗa aa tara aasaka'a a̱ tyo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11" />Reve u usu, &lt;&lt;A̱ tyo e iɗa ya Babila adama a suwaa yi u'wa. Reve no o koto, a zuwa pe aasaka'a a̱ nda̱na̱ta̱ ma̱ yi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 5:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6" />
  <para style="s">Alavu alavu e ikeke yi ido i na̱shi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1" />Reve n ka̱lyuwisa̱ zuva reve me ene ikeke yi ido i na̱shi o uta̱ e memere ma nsasan n re, nsasa'an gba nsasan mu rumushili n ɗa! <verse eid="ZEC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2" />Keke vu do vu ufaru, ido i shili i ɗa i da̱na̱i o ronoso yi, za ve ire a̱za̱ a̱ lima̱, <verse eid="ZEC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3" />za va ta'atsu ido i uri, za va̱ na̱shi gba ido i pusa̱ pusa̱ suru nle a̱za̱ o ucira. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4" />Reve me ece malingata ma na ma̱ shi a yuwusan adanshi na̱ a̱mu'u, &lt;&lt;Nye i ɗa nda'a, zagbain va̱?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5" />Reve u usu mu u damma, &lt;&lt;Ele nda nan ruhu a̱ na̱shi a ɗa, aza a na o uta̱i diga zuva cina o roco aciyele a̱ ma̱ka̱ka̱n ma zagbain vu uvaɗi ma̱ɓula̱. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6" />Keke vi ido na ri ni ido i lima̱ a̱ ta̱ tyo upasu wi iɗa yu ugana, za na ri ni ido i uri a̱ tyo upasu wa̱ a̱livu, za na gba ri ni ido i pusa̱ pusa̱ a̱ tyo upasu wu uyagi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7" />Ana ido yu ucira'a o uta̱i, a̱ shi ta̱ a maluwa ma na e reme agara a̱tsuma̱ o uvaɗi. Reve A̱sulazuva a damma le, &lt;&lt;Ya̱wa̱i i gara uvaɗi ma̱ɓula̱!&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa a garai uvaɗi. <verse eid="ZEC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8" />Reve malingata'a u ɗe mu, &lt;&lt;Uwwa nda, aza a na a saɓai a̱ tyo upasu wi iɗa yu ugana a ca ta̱ Ruhu va̱ wivuwun a̱tsuma̱ e iɗa yu ugana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ookokolo oɓolo na̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9" />Reve adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱ ana, <verse eid="ZEC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10" />&lt;&lt;Ushi azurufa na̱ zinariya ya aza a na a̱ pura̱i Helda na̱ Tobiya na̱ Jedaya aza a na a̱ ka̱mba̱i diga Babila, a̱vu fo vu 'ya̱wa̱ o u'wa wa Josaya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Josaya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Uvadalasa u ro aala a na a yuwayin ulinga a̱yi ɗa Hen.</char></note> ulobo wa Zafaniya o urana'a. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11" />Vu tara azurufa'a na̱ zinariya'a vu yuwan ookokolo, reve vo oto yi a aaci a̱ Josuwa ulobo wa Jehozada, ganu gbain. <verse eid="ZEC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12" />A̱vu vu damma yi, apa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;Apa nda vuma na aala a̱ yi a ɗa eten, u ta yuwan eten diga uba̱ta̱ u na wu uta̱i, a̱vu u suwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13" />A̱yi ɗa waa suwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva, reve u da̱na̱ wotowu na̱ tsugbain reve u da̱nu u yuwan tsugono o ootogu a̱ yi. Waru u ta̱ da̱na̱ na̱ ganu o upasu wo ootogu o tsugono tsa̱ yi. Reve ele ra a̱ da̱na̱ a muwwulai.&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14" />Ookokolo'o a̱ ta̱ da̱na̱ a̱ A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva wo o'wo macuwayin ma Helem na̱ Tobiya na̱ Jedaya na̱ Josaya ulobo wa Zafaniya. <verse eid="ZEC 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15" />Aza a na a̱ ri alanga a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ a kamba a suwa A̱a̱'isamapaɗa a̱ A̱sulazuva. Ɗaɗa yee reve a na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva ɗa lyungu mu ya̱'a̱ ɗu. Agba ili i nda i ta shiwan na̱ vu yuwan tsutoni nu uɗyo wa̱ A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ wu ulobonu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7" />
  <para style="s">A̱sulazuva a 'yuwan ta̱ akuli e ikpa'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1" />A aa'wan a̱ na̱shi o Mogono Dariyu, adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ ya Zakariya o urana wa̱ na̱shi u woto wa̱ kucci, za na a̱yi ɗa Kislev. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2" />Cina Betel Shareza lyungu ɗe Regemele oɓolo na ama e le, a zami isa'ani ya̱ A̱sulazuva, <verse eid="ZEC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3" />e ece nan ganu vu u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva na ama̱sula̱, &lt;&lt;N shon a̱vu n yuwan akuli o woto wa tawun, cine n yuwain a'wan na̱ a̱bunda̱?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4" />Reve adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱ ana, <verse eid="ZEC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5" />&lt;&lt;Ece a ama e iɗa'a suru na̱ nan ganu, &lt;A mantsa ma na i yuwain akuli na̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu o woto wa tawun na̱ woto we cindere a̱tsuma̱ a a'wan kupocindere'e, na amayun a ɗa adama a̱ va̱ a ɗa i yuwain akuli'i? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6" />Waru a na i da̱na̱i a alya ni i sowi, adama a aciya̱ɗu a ɗa i lyuwusai ni i sowi shi? <verse eid="ZEC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7" />Ele nda ele ɗa adanshi a na A̱sulazuva a dammai o una̱ wa ama̱sula̱ o ufaru, a mantsa ma na Urishelima ni ilyuci i na i ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ a̱yi a̱ tsura̱i ulyuwu we elime, oɓolo na̱ Nege nu upasu wa̱ a̱livu wi iɗa i mugaɗi i na i ri na ama shi?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8" />Reve adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ da̱shi ta̱wa̱ ya Zakariya adansa, <verse eid="ZEC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9" />&lt;&lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;I yuwan uge'etosu wa amayun, i rocoloi isa'ani ni iliyali. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10" />She i ɓongi ma̱runa̱ ko makpa'an wan na̱ mocin na̱ za vu ulambu wan. She i yuwunlai majiyan me iwuya o okolo a̱ ɗu wan.&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11" />&lt;&lt;Agba a̱vu a 'yuwan o polo atsuvu, a̱vu a vadala ucina̱ u le na aciyogbamu, a̱vu a ula atsuvu e le adama a uwwa wan. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12" />Reve a gbawato asuvu e le tsa a̱ta̱mba̱ adama a uwwa wila̱ ko adanshi a na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱ lyunguyi e ekere a̱ Ruhu va̱ yi wan o una̱ wa ama̱sula̱ o ufaru. Adama o ndolo a ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a yuwain upan ne ele lon. <verse eid="ZEC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13" />&lt;Ana n ɗeyi, a uwwa shi, ne ɗa fo ne e ɗe maa uwwa shi,&gt; &gt;&gt; ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. <verse eid="ZEC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14" />&lt;&lt;M bete'we le ta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa na̱ lipa̱, uba̱ta̱ u na e revei shi. Ne ɗa iɗa i na a lyawai wo o'woi ofoli, hali na ko za aa gura gara pe shi. Ne ɗa o o'wotoi iɗa i sa'ani ofoli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8" />
  <para style="s">Ifoɓi isa'ani ya̱ A̱sulazuva e ekere a̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1" />Reve adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱ ta̱wisa̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱ a dansa,<verse eid="ZEC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2" />&lt;&lt;Apa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:2">&lt;N ta̱ na̱ tsushu'un tsa Sihiyona lon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:2">n ta̱ a̱ ma̱puna̱ na̱ tsushu'un adama a̱ yi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3" />&lt;&lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva a dammai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:3">&lt;N ta̱ ka̱mba̱ Sihiyona a̱vu n da̱nu Urishelima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:3">Reve e ɗe Urishelima Lyuci Gbain va Amayun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:3">masasan ma̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:3">waru Masasan ma Akiza.&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4" />Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:4">&lt;Mbara na̱ mukuci n ta̱ da̱nuwisa̱ e re va̱ Urishelima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:4">za suru na aaɗanga o ukere wa̱ yi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:4">adama a tsukutsa lon.<verse eid="ZEC 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5" />Waru re lyuci gbai'in a ta shiwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:5">no olobo ne esheli</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:5">a yuwusan uro e re'e.&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6" />Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:6">&lt;Ko na̱ shi wo o'wo she damma ili i na yaa yuwan shi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:6">e yeni ya akapi a na a pasai a mantsa mo ndolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:6">o to o'wo fo she damma ili i na yaa yuwan shi e yeni i va̱?&gt; &gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:6">Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai.<verse eid="ZEC 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7" />Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:7">&lt;&lt;Ka̱lyuwai, n ta wawa ama a̱ va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:7">diga e iɗa ya asana ni iɗa ya̱ a̱livu.<verse eid="ZEC 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8" />Waru n ta̱ ka̱mba̱to le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:8">adama a̱ da̱nu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 8:8">Reve o o'wo ama a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:8">a̱vu mo o'wo A̱sula̱ e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 8:8">a̱tsuma̱ a amayun na̱ a̱ɓula̱.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9" />Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;Lyawa ekere a̱ ɗu a gbama, a̱ɗu na a rana nda yaa uwwusa a yuwusan adanshi a nda diga o una̱ wa ama̱sula̱ a na a̱ shi lo o urana u na a varai ikyun yu usaa wu u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, adama a suwa a̱a̱'isa̱'a̱.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10" />Adama a na kafu mantsa mo ndolo a̱ shi a tsu tsupa vuma ko iliyamunga shi. Ko za shi tsu gura 'ya̱wa̱ ulinga wa̱ yi babu wovon wu n'yuwatan shi, adama a na n shi ta̱ n zuwa za suru n'yuwunlai na̱ za va̱ yi. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11" />Agba gogo maa yuwan na akapi a ama a nda cine n yuwain ɗe a̱ca̱pa̱ shi, ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. <verse eid="ZEC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12" />&lt;&lt;Adama a na a ta yuwan ca̱'a̱n na asuvu nden. Ataci a ina̱bi a ta ca umatsun wa̱ yi. Iɗa i ta ca limatan va̱ yi, zuva waru ta ca a'iza a̱ yi. N ta ca akapi a ama a na a pasai ili i nda woo o'wo za le. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13" />A̱ɗu u'wa wa Yahuda na̱ Isra'ila, cine i shi yo o'woi iroci yu una̱ a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa, ne ɗa maa wawa ɗu, waru i to o'wo aba'un. She yu uwwa wovon wan, amma lyawa ekere a̱ ɗu a gbama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14" />Adama a na apa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;Cine n foɓoi n ta̱wa̱a̱ ɗu na̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱ a mantsa ma na nkaya n ɗu n zuwa numu n yuwain upan, agba m bula̱ shi.&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. <verse eid="ZEC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15" />&lt;&lt;Adama o ndolo n foɓo ta̱ n yuwaan Urishelima isa'ani a yashi i nda nu u'wa wa Yahuda, she yu uwwa wovon wan. <verse eid="ZEC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16" />Apa nda ili i na yaa yuwan, koyan ɗa damma za va̱ yi amayun, a̱vu i yuwan uge'etosu wa amayun na̱ za va̱ a̱ɓula̱ o ukobu wu uge'etosu ɗu. <verse eid="ZEC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17" />She i foɓoo nron ma̱ nden ɗu iwuya wan, waru she i ciga akucunu e epen wan,&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. <verse eid="ZEC 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18" />Reve adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱ ta̱wisa̱ ya̱'a̱ va̱, a dansa, <verse eid="ZEC 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19" />&lt;&lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;Akuli o woto wa̱ na̱shi na̱ wo woto wa tawun, na̱ wo woto we cindere na̱ wo woto wa kupa, o to o'wo mantsa ma̱ ma̱za̱nga̱ na̱ mere nu uyo'o e ekere o u'wa wa Yahuda, a mantsa ma̱ a̱buki a na a zuwai. Adama o ndolo, i ciga amayun na asuvu nden.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20" />Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, &lt;&lt;Ama a̱ a̱bunda̱ na aza a na a̱ ri nden e ilyuci i gbagbain na̱ a̱bunda̱ a buwa ta̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱. <verse eid="ZEC 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21" />A̱za̱ a̱ lyuci ta̱, a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱wa̱ a̱ lyuci ro, a̱vu a damma, &lt;Ta̱wa̱i tsu walai gogo, tsu zamiyi isa'ani ya̱ A̱sulazuva, a̱vu tsu zamiyi A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva. <verse eid="ZEC 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22" />Ama a̱ a̱bunda̱ na̱ nɗa mu ucira a̱ ta̱ ta̱wa̱ Urishelima a zami isa'ani ya̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23" />&lt;&lt;Apa ili i na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai, a̱tsuma̱ a yashi i ndolo ali kupa diga a nɗa me elentsu suru, e te reme utugu u vuma va Yahuda a̱vu a damma, &lt;Lyawa tsu kuru wu, adama a na tsu uwwa ta̱ a na A̱sula̱ a̱ ri oɓolo na̱ a̱vu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 8:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9" />
  <para style="s">Ikaka yu uge'etosu yi nɗa ni iwawi ya̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1" />Apa ikaka ya̱ A̱sulazuva a aci e iɗa ya Hadra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">waru u ta̱ cipa̱ a aci a Dimaska.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:1">Adama a na esu a̱ A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ uba̱ta̱ u vuma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:1">oɓolo na̱ gundo va aza a Isra'ila suru.<verse eid="ZEC 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2" />Esu a̱ yi fo a ta a aci a Hamat,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:2">za na ri na̱ a̱tyo na̱ Dimaska.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:2">Oɓolo na̱ Taya na̱ Sidon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:2">ko na wo o'woi a̱ tu nu ugbozu lon.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3" />Taya suwaa ta̱ aciya̱yi uba̱ta̱ wu ucira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">a̱vu u gangato azurufa tsa̱ ma̱buta̱ ma̱ ma̱bula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:3">na̱ zinariya tsa yiyaɓan yu ure u gbain.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4" />Ka̱lyuwa̱, A̱sulazuva a ta usa yi ili i na u ri na̱ a̱yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">reve u kototo ucira wa̱ yi a̱tsuma̱ a mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:4">waru akina a ɗa aa lyuwa yi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5" />Ashikelon te ene yi reve wu uwwa wovon.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gaza fo te je'en lipu a̱tsuma̱ o wovon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">oɓolo na̱ Ekuron fo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">adama a na ili i na wa zuwusaa okolo u to ɓoso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gaza ta lamba mogono ma̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:5">Ashikelon waru to o'wo ofoli.<verse eid="ZEC 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6" />Ugundo wa̱ a̱girutu a ɗa a̱a̱ da̱nu pe Ashido,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:6">agba n to koɗo uvaɗu wa Filistiya.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7" />N ta tawa mpasa o una̱ wa̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">oɓolo ni ili idaba ya̱ yi, e memere ma anga a̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Akapi a̱ yi a na a pasai fo, o to o'wo a̱za̱ a̱ A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">O to o'wo tso umatsun a̱tsuma̱ a Yahuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:7">reve Ekuron o'wo tsa aza a Jebusiya.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8" />Amma n ta̱ piri u'wa u va̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">e ekere a aza a na a̱a̱ 'ya̱wusa̱ na̱ a̱ ka̱mbi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">Ko za vi iɓongi a̱a̱ da̱shi kuru na̱ pe shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:8">adama a na gogo n ta̱ ka̱lyuwusa̱ uba̱ta̱'a̱ ne esu a̱ va̱.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uka̱mbu u mogono ma̱ Sihiyona</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9" />Yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ lon, a̱vu Usheli Sihiyona!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">Oruwo, a̱vu Usheli Urishelima!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Ka̱lyuwa̱, mogono ma̱ ɗu moo ta̱ lo a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ ɗu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">Za va̱ a̱ɓula̱ ɗa, waru za vu ulyuwu wa aci.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">U tara aciya̱yi ili i ro shi ukumbu o mololi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:9">zuva molloli ɗa u ri ukumbu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:5">Mat 21:5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:15">Yah 12:15</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ZEC 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10" />N ta tawa ikeke yi ido diga ya Ifiramu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">ni ido yu uvon diga Urishelima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">utan wu uvon waru u ta kuɗa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">U ta yuwaan nɗa adanshi a̱ nden ma asuvu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">Tsugono tsa̱ yi tsa̱ te reme diga a mala a̱ tyo a mala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:10">na̱ diga o Uɗolu a̱ tyo o ukosu wu uvaɗi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11" />Amma a̱vu gba, adama a mpasa ma akucunu a̱ va̱ na̱ a̱vu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:11">n ta lyawa a̱za̱ a̱ wu a na a̱ ri o u'wa wa ali,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:11">diga a̱ wa̱cin u na u ri na̱ mini shi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12" />Ka̱mba̱i o upa'atan wu ucira u ɗu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:12">a̱ɗu agbashi a na a zuwusa okolo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:12">Adama a na gogo n ta tsupa ɗu toto ure.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13" />N ta̱ ka̱nza̱ Yahuda tsu utan u va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">a̱vu n shiton yi na̱ Ifiramu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">N ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n olobo a̱ wu a̱vu Sihiyona, a aci olobo a Javan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:13">a̱vu n vuta̱la̱ wu tsa matsun me pe'eni ma za na gurai uvon.<verse eid="ZEC 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14" />Reve A̱sulazuva a̱a̱ ta̱wa̱ ya̱'a̱ le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">a̱vu aya a̱ yi o uta̱ tsi imaɗatsu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">A̱sulazuva zagbain ta̱ e ivula̱ aavana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:14">a̱vu u wala o uta̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ lipa̱ vu uyagi,<verse eid="ZEC 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15" />A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ta yuwaan le a̱a̱ra̱ga̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">A̱ to una n'yuwatan na atali a̱ a̱bitsutsu, reve a dasa le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">A̱vu o sowo o oruwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">she damma a̱ tu usowu na̱ ma̱ra̱.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">A ta shunwa tsa aasa'atsu a na a̱ tsu kyo'onu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:15">mpasa eɓele a masa'a.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16" />O urana u ndolo A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ e le a ta wawa le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">tso oɓolo e ikyon a ama a̱ yi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">Adama a na a̱ te ikana e iɗa ya̱ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:16">tsa atali e ikebe okokolo o tsugono.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17" />Cine maluwa nu ulobonu u le wa̱ da̱na̱!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">Olobo a ta yuwan a̱bunda̱ tse ishina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 9:17">esheli waru tsa masayan ma sa'avu.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10" />
  <para style="s">A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ Yahuda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1" />Ecei A̱sulazuva iro'i a mantsa ma̱ lyushi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">A̱sulazuva a ɗa a tsu yuwan wunla̱.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">A̱yi ɗa u tsu ca ama iro'i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:1">no ototopi atsusa uba̱ta̱ wa ama.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2" />Adama a na a̱ma̱li a ta yuwusan adanshi e epen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">oboci a̱ ta̱ e inda alavu alavu e epen.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">A ta dansa alavu a na a̱ ri epen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">a casu ofoli a adanshi a̱ nden ma asuvu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Adama o ndolo a ɗa ama a̱ ri a agara e iwau</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">tse e ikyon i na o ɓongiyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:2">adama o ulambu wu za va aguɓa.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3" />Upan u va̱ u ta̱ a̱ ma̱puna̱ a aci aza a aguɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">waru n ta ca azagbain a̱tsuma̱lima̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">adama a na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">a̱ ta̱ goloɓo oɓolo e ikyon ya̱ yi, u'wa wa Yahuda.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">A̱vu u zuwa le o o'wo tso do</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:3">vu uvaɗu a̱tsuma̱ o uvon.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4" />Diga Yahuda ɗa a̱a̱ tsura̱ aatali e ikyun yu usaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">diga ya̱'a̱ yi ɗa a̱a̱ tsura̱ rumu ma̱shuwa̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:4">diga ya̱'a̱ yi ɗa a̱a̱ tsura̱ utan wu uvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:4">diga ya̱'a̱ yi ɗa a̱a̱ tsura̱ zagbain suru.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5" />Ama a Yahuda'a suru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">o to o'wo tsa ama a na a gurai uvon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">a dasasa n'yuwatan a̱tsuma̱ o yilyo'o yu ure u gbain a̱tsuma̱ o uvon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">Adama a na A̱sulazuva a̱ ri oɓolo ne ele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:5">a ta yuwan uvon a̱vu a ca akumbi e ido wono.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6" />&lt;&lt;N ta gbamato u'wa wa Yahuda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">a̱vu n wawa u'wa wa̱ Isuhu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">N ta̱ ka̱mba̱to le</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">adama a na n te inda iliyali i le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">O to o'wo she damma gashi n shi n 'yuwan le shi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">adama a na a̱mu ɗa A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ e le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:6">n ta̱ gba a̱ usu le.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7" />Ama a Ifiramu o to o'wo tsa ama o ucira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">a̱vu waru okolo e le a yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">she damma o sowo ta̱ masayan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">Muwun n le n te ene yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">reve a yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:7">okolo e le a ta yuwan ma̱za̱nga̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8" />N ta ca le iroci,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">a̱vu m ɓoloto le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">Na amayun n ta wawa le,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:8">waru o to o'wo a̱bunda̱ tsu ufaru.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9" />Ko na wo o'woi m bete'we nle a̱tsuma̱ a nɗa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">suru na̱ ne diga ba̱ta̱ va alanga a ta cuwan na̱ a̱mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">Ele na̱ muwun n le a ta la'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:9">a̱vu a̱ ka̱mba̱.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10" />N ta̱ ka̱mba̱to le diga e iɗa ya Masar</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">a̱vu m ɓoloto le diga Asiriya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">N ta̱ ta̱wa̱ ne ele e iɗa ya Giliyadu na̱ Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:10">hali she nu ure u ka̱la̱ma̱ le.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11" />A mantsa ma na a uwai a mala ma̱ a̱tsuma̱lima̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">a̱mu A̱sulazuva, n to voton ikeɗu i mala'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">waru a̱ru'un a̱ Nilu e te 'yewe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">A̱ ta̱ ka̱ɗa̱to uvaɗu wa Asiriya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:11">ucira u tsugbain tsa Masar gba tso to koto.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12" />N ta gbamato le a̱tsuma̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">reve a wala a̱tsuma̱ a ala a̱ yi,&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 10:12">ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11" />
  <para style="s">A̱sulazuva o to kototo n'yuwatan ma ama a̱ yi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1" />Kpa̱tu'wa̱ na̱ntsu va̱ wu, a̱vu Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:1">adama akina a tama ɗanga sida va̱ wu!<verse eid="ZEC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2" />Shon a̱vu uɗanga u fir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">adama a na sida riya̱ ta̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">o kototo ta̱ ɗanga vu ucira na ri ulobonu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Shoyin a̱ɗu ɗanga Oku va Bashan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:2">adama a na o koɗo ta̱ a̱a̱rumbu e irumbu!<verse eid="ZEC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3" />Uwwai mesun ma aza a aguɓa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">adama a na o kototo ta̱ uba̱ta̱ wa alyuna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">o ulobonu u le!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Uwwai mesun me ikamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">adama a na o kototo ta̱</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:3">a̱a̱rumbu a̱ Urudu!<verse eid="ZEC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4" />Apa nda ili i na A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ a dammai, &lt;&lt;Vu yuwan aguɓa o oɓolo e ikyon i na a tawai adama a paɗa. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5" />Aza a na aa tsulusa le a ta paɗasa le reve gba a̱ ka̱ra̱ fa̱a̱n. Aza a na aa winasa le a ta dansa, &lt;A̱sulazuva za va aba'un a ɗa, adama a na mo o'wo ta̱ za vu utsuru.&gt; Aza a aguɓa e le ee inda iliyali i le shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma, &lt;&lt;M buwa ee ene iliyali ya ama e iɗa'a shi, n ta ca za suru e ekere o moron ma̱ nden ma̱ yi na̱ mogono ma̱ yi. O to ɓongi iɗa'a, waru maa wawa le e ekere e le shi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7" />Ɗaɗa mo o'woi za va aguɓa vo oɓolo e ikyon i na aza a atsulu na awina a tawai adama a mapaɗa. Reve n tara aɗanga e re, a̱vu n ɗe za ta̱, &lt;&lt;Isa'ani&gt;&gt; za va ire, &lt;&lt;Uɓolu wa Aci.&gt;&gt; Reve n guɓa ikyo'on. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8" />A̱tsuma̱ o woto uta̱, n tawa ta̱ aza a aguɓa a ta'atsu'u, adama a na n kuna̱ ta̱ ne ele, ele fo a 'yuwan mu ta̱. <verse eid="ZEC 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9" />Ɗaɗa n dammai, &lt;&lt;Moo o'wo za va aguɓa ɗu shi. Za na a̱a̱ kuwa̱, u kuwa̱. Ili i na oo kototo, lyawa o kototo yi. Lyawa aza a na a la'ai a tamalai inama i lipu le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10" />Reve n tara aaɗanga a̱ va̱ a na a̱ tsu ɗe Isa'ani, a̱vu n kuɗa yi, a kuɗusa akucunu a na n yuwain na̱ gundo va aza a Isra'ila suru. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11" />A̱vu gba a kuɗa akucunu'u o urana u ndolo, ɗaɗa aza a atsulu na awina a na a̱ shi a̱ a̱ka̱nla̱ a̱ va̱, e revei a na adanshi a̱ A̱sulazuva a ɗa. <verse eid="ZEC 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12" />Reve n damma le, &lt;&lt;Nna̱ ye ene u lobono ɗu ta̱, ca numu atsupu a̱ va̱. Agba na ne ɗa shi, i guza̱ ili i ɗu.&gt;&gt; Ɗaɗa a tsupa numu ukunzuwu u Azurufa mata'atsu.<verse eid="ZEC 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma mu, &lt;&lt;Vari le o uzuwata.&gt;&gt; Atsulu a na wu ntsayi a tsula mu. Ɗaɗa n tarai ikebe i azurufa mata'atsu'u a̱vu n vari le a̱tsuma̱ o u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva uba̱ta̱ wu uzuwata'a. <verse eid="ZEC 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14" />Reve n kuɗa, &lt;&lt;Uɓolu wa Aci&gt;&gt; aaɗanga e ire a̱ va̱, za na rocoi wukasu u muwwulai ma Yahuda na̱ Isra'ila. <verse eid="ZEC 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15" />Reve A̱sulazuva a damma mu, &lt;&lt;Tarisa itana yu ulo yi za va aguɓa. <verse eid="ZEC 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16" />Adama a na, n ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n za va aguɓa e iɗa'a za na damai na a ɗa a aza a na o kototoi shi, ko u zami muwun nna mu uwwai usa̱n u ka̱mba̱to le gbaga shi. Ko gba u lyuwato aza a na a̱ shi gbaga shi, amma u to soɗu inama ya aza a na a̱ ri mgbain, a sazasa okotsu e le.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17" />&lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱lima̱ a ta cina za va aguɓa vama va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">za na tsu lyawa oɓolo e ikyon!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Lyawa matsun me pe'eni ma gasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">ukere wa̱ yi na̱ lyusu vu ukere u sa'ani wa̱ yi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Lyawa ukere wa̱ yi u sowo suru suru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 11:17">lyusu vu ukere u sa'ani va̱ yi rumba̱na̱ suru suru!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 11:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12" />
  <para style="s">Iwawi adama a̱ Urishelima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1" />Apa nda ikaka ya̱ A̱sulazuva a aci a Isra'ila. A̱sulazuva a na a yuwain zuva waru shuwa̱i uvaɗi a̱vu fo u yuwaan vuma ruhu a̱tsuma̱ a̱ yi damma ta̱, <verse eid="ZEC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2" />&lt;&lt;Uwwai, n ta zama mo o'woto Urishelima mokkoto mo utakalyuwu e ekere ama a na a̱ ri uka̱nda̱ruwu na̱ yi. A mantsa ma na a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱i Urishelima a̱ ta̱ fo a̱ ka̱nda̱ruwa̱ Yahuda. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3" />O urana u ndolo, a mantsa ma na nɗa m ɓoloi aci a̱ riya̱a̱ yi, n to o'woto Urishelima aatali o ume e ekere a nɗa suru. Aza na biti a cigai a tanu yi suru a ta amaton aciyele.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4" />&lt;&lt;O urana u ndolo n ta faba do suru na̱ wovon, kumbi va̱ yi waru nu ujaru, agba n ta zuwa esu a̱ va̱ o u'wa wa Yahuda, reve n rumba̱na̱to ido yi iɗa'a suru.&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5" />&lt;&lt;Ɗaɗa azagbain a Yahuda aa damma o okolo e le, &lt;Ama a̱ Urishelima a̱ ta̱ nu ucira, adama a na A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a ɗa A̱sula̱ e le.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6" />O urana u ndolo n to o'woto azagbain a Yahuda tso upondo wa akina e memere ma akina, tsa aakata a akina e memere ma akatalu. O to soɗu ama a na a̱ ri uka̱nda̱ruwu a̱ tyo usa'ani nu ugula̱. Agba Urishelima ta̱ da̱na̱ na ama uba̱ta̱ u na u ri. <verse eid="ZEC 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7" />A̱sulazuva a ta wawa nda̱na̱ta̱ ma Yahuda ne'e, adama tsugbain tsu u'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda na̱ za va aza a na a̱ ri nden Urishelima u la'a za va Yahuda wan.<verse eid="ZEC 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8" />&lt;&lt;O urana u ndolo n te geshe aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden Urishelima, adama za na ka̱la̱ma̱i ucira suru suru a̱tsuma̱ e le o urana u ndolo wo o'wo nu ucira tsa̱ Da̱wuda. U'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda waru u to o'wo tsa̱ A̱sula̱, tsa a malingata ma̱ A̱sulazuva elime e le. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9" />O urana u ndolo n to uta̱ adama n kototo nɗa n na n ta̱wa̱i a yuwan uvon na̱ Urishelima.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mesun adama a za na a sapai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10" />&lt;&lt;Reve n tsuwa̱a̱n u'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda na aza a na a̱ ri nden Urishelima ruhu mene me iliyali na̱ za mayan ma avasa. A̱ ta̱ ka̱lyuwa̱ mu, za na a sapai, reve a yuwaan yi mesun ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu, cine za tsu yuwan mesun ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu a mawun ma̱ ta̱ ma̱ yi goon. Reve a yuwan mesun lon adama a̱ yi, cine vuma tsu yuwan mesun lon adama a mawun mo ufaru ma̱ yi mo ulobo. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11" />O urana u ndolo mesun ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu ma̱ a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima u ta yuwan tsa̱ mesun ma na a yuwain adama a Hadad Rimon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hadad Rimon </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A ta majiyan na aala a Ba'al o ro a ɗa, ana a̱ yi, a̱sula̱ a̱ yitopishi yi iɗa ya Ka'ana na̱ Suriya ɗa.</char></note> a agalaci a Megido. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12" />Iɗa'a i ta yuwan mesun ma̱ a̱tsumola̱ngu, u'wa suru o una̱ wa aciya̱yi. U'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda o una̱ wa aciya̱yi, a̱ma̱ci e le waru o una̱ wa aciyele. Umatsun wu u'wa wa Natan o una̱ wa aciya̱yi, na̱ a̱ma̱ci e le waru o una̱ wa aciyele. <verse eid="ZEC 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13" />Umatsun wu u'wa wa̱ Levi u ta̱ shon o una̱ wa aciya̱yi, na̱ a̱ma̱ci e le waru o una̱ wa aciyele. Umatsun wu u'wa aza a Shimeyi u ta̱ shon o una̱ wa aciya̱yi, na̱ a̱ma̱ci e le waru o una̱ wa aciyele. <verse eid="ZEC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14" />Akapi o umatsun wu 'wa na buwai suru, za suru o una̱ wa aciya̱yi, na̱ a̱ma̱ci e le waru o una̱ wa aciyele.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13" />
  <para style="s">Matawa mo unusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1" />&lt;&lt;O urana u ndolo, a̱ ta̱ kpa̱tu'wa̱a̱ u'wa wa̱ Da̱wuda lyusu mini na aza a na a̱ ri na̱ nden Urishelima, adama a̱ za̱'wa̱ unusu ni idaba. <verse eid="ZEC 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2" />O urana u ndolo, n ta tasa ala a̱ a̱ma̱li diga e iɗa'a, hali na a̱a̱ da̱shi cuwan ne ele waru shi, waru n ta tawa ama̱sula̱ oɓolo na̱ ruhu vi idaba diga e iɗa'a.&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3" />&lt;&lt;Agba na̱ za ro buwa a yuwusan adanshi e ili i na yaa fara, dada va̱ yi na̱ mma va̱ yi aza a na a matsan niyi, a ta damma yi, &lt;Na̱ vu ciga vu 'yuwan vu kuwa̱, adama a na vu yuwan ta̱ epen na ala a̱ A̱sulazuva.&gt; &gt;&gt; Reve dada va̱ yi na̱ mma va̱ yi a sapa yi mantsa ma na waa yuwusan adanshi e ili i na yaa fara'a. <verse eid="ZEC 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4" />O urana u ndolo vumava̱sula̱ suru ta uwwa wono wa alavu alavu a̱ yi a adanshi e ili i na yaa fara. Woo oto utugu we eleme wa vumava̱sula̱ adama wu luma̱ ama shi. <verse eid="ZEC 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5" />&lt;&lt;Amma u ta damma, &lt;A̱mu vumava̱sula̱ ɗa shi, a̱mu cimbi ɗa, iɗa i ɗa ure wi ilyalya i va̱ diga a̱mu a mawun.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ZEC 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6" />&lt;&lt;Reve na̱ za ro ece yi, &lt;Nye i ta̱wa̱i na antsu a nda a̱ lipu va̱ wu?&gt; U ta̱ usu, &lt;Antsu a na n tsura̱i a 'wa vu n'utsa̱ n va̱ n ɗa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱ ga̱la̱ ta̱ za va aguɓa reve ikyon i bete'we</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7" />&lt;&lt;Jiwan, matsun me pe'eni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">vu riya̱a̱ za va aguɓa a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">vuma na ri zuzu na̱ a̱mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">ga̱la̱ za va Aguɓa, a̱vu ikyon i bete'we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">n ta vadala ukere u va̱ n ga̱la̱ a̱za̱ e keke'en.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:7">Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a dammai,<verse eid="ZEC 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8" />&lt;&lt;A̱tsuma̱ e iɗa'a ma̱ɓula̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">a̱ ta̱ ga̱la̱ uɓatsulai ure a̱tsuma̱ o uɓatsulai uta'atsu a̱vu a̱ kuwa̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:8">a̱vu a lyawa uɓatsulai u ta̱ wuma.&gt;&gt; Ne ɗa A̱sulazuva a dammai.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9" />&lt;&lt;A̱vu n vari za ta'atsu nda a̱tsuma̱ a akina.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">N ta lapula le cine a tsu lapula azurufa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">reve n rito le cine a tsu rito zinariya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">E te ɗe ala a̱ va̱,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">a̱vu gba n usu le.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">N ta damma, &lt;Ele ama a̱ va a ɗa,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ZEC 13:9">a̱vu ele a damma, &lt;A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ tsu a ɗa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ZEC 13:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14" />
  <para style="s">A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱wa̱ ta̱ u yuwan tsugbain</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1" />Uwwai nda, urana wa̱ A̱sulazuva u ta̱ ta̱wa̱, ana ee ne'eshen ili i na a̱ pura̱i ya̱'a̱ ɗu e memere ma̱ ɗu. <verse eid="ZEC 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2" />Adama a na n to ɓoloto nɗa suru a̱ ta̱wa̱ a yuwan uvon na̱ Urishelima. A ta usa lyuci'i, a̱vu a̱ pura̱ itana yu 'wa le, a̱vu fo o von na̱ a̱ma̱ci ne ele babu ucigu. Uɓatsulai u lyuci'i u ta̱ ka̱ra̱ a̱ 'ya̱wa̱ tsugbashi. Waru a ta lyawa akapi a ama a̱ lyuci'i. <verse eid="ZEC 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3" />Reve A̱sulazuva o uta̱ u yuwan uvon na̱ nɗa n ndolo'o cine u tsu yuwan o urana wu uvon.<verse eid="ZEC 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4" />O urana u ndolo ana a̱ yi e te isawan a Masasan ma̱ Zetun, asana a̱ Urishelima, reve e ne'eshen Masasan ma̱ Zetun ure diga asana a̱ tyo a̱livu, u yuwan uka̱ri u washin, hali na uɓatsulai u masasa'an waa wala a̱ tyo upasu wu ugana. Reve uɓatsulai we ire waru u wala a̱ tyo uyagi. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5" />I ta suma i kuru nu uka̱ri u masasan ma̱ va̱, adama a na u ta rawa Azel. I ta suma cine i sumai ura̱mosu wi iɗa a mantsa ma Uziya mogono ma Yahuda. A̱vu A̱sulazuva A̱sula̱ a̱ va̱ a̱ ta̱wa̱ oɓolo na aza a akiza suru. <verse eid="ZEC 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6" />O urana u ndolo aa yuwan ekan shi ko uta̱nu shi ko ili i ro weshe weshe shi. <verse eid="ZEC 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7" />U to o'wo urana la̱nga̱, babu urana ko ayin, urana u na A̱sulazuva e revei na̱ a̱yi. Reve nu ulivu a yuwan ekan.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8" />O urana u ndolo, mini ma na ma̱ tsu ca wuma ma̱ te yene o uta̱ diga Urishelima, akapi a̱ tyo a mala ma asana akapi waru a̱ tyo a mala ma̱ a̱livu, a mantsa ma̱ lyushi na̱ mantsa me irana suru.<verse eid="ZEC 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9" />A̱sulazuva o to o'wo mogono mo uvaɗi suru. O urana u ndolo A̱sulazuva a̱ ta̱ a ɗa a̱a̱ da̱na̱ lo, na aala a̱ ta̱.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10" />Iɗa'a suru, diga Geba a̱ tyo Rimon uyagi wa̱ Urishelima u to o'wo agalaci. Agba a̱ ta̱ 'ya̱sa̱n Urishelima zuva uba̱ta̱ u na u ri diga o Una̱ntsu wa Banyami a̱ tyo upasu wu Una̱ntsu wu Ufaru, waru na̱ a̱ tyo o Una̱ntsu u ro na a̱ tsu ɗe Okonji, na̱ diga a Aatsura a Hanane a̱ tyo uba̱ta̱ u mokpoko u masayan mo mogono. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11" />U to o'wo uba̱ta̱ wa asuvu nden, a̱a̱ da̱shi kototo yi shi. Urishelima to o'wo fa̱a̱n.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12" />Apa nda mɓa̱la̱ n na A̱sulazuva a fabaa nɗa n na n yuwain uvon na̱ Urishelima suru, lipu le ta shama ele ubuwu mishin na ana e le. Esu e le waru a ta shama a̱tsuma̱ o okoko e le, elentsu e le waru a ta shama a̱tsuma̱ a̱ na̱ le. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13" />Waru o urana u ndolo wovon wa̱ a̱bunda̱ diga uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva u te reme ama. Vuma suru te reme ukere wu za va̱ yi a̱vu a lapulai. <verse eid="ZEC 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14" />Hali na̱ Yahuda fo ta yuwan nla̱ngi na̱ Urishelima. A ta usa utsuru wu nɗa n na n ri uka̱nda̱ruwu suru, oɓolo na̱ nan zinariya na̱ azurufa na̱ a̱tugu o uga'an a̱ a̱bunda̱. <verse eid="ZEC 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15" />Waru mɓa̱la̱ cu'un vu za nda te reme ido na̱ nloli na arakumi na̱ nloli mi ido, na̱ cu'un vi iliyamunga i na suru i ri a̱ va̱la̱ta̱ ndolo.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16" />Reve akapi a na a pasai a nɗa n na n yuwain uvon na̱ Urishelima suru, a gawan aa'wan suru a̱ tyo Urishelima adama a yuwaan Mogono A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱ga̱nda̱, waru a yuwan A̱buki o Ogodo o Ucuwusan. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17" />Agba na̱ vuma ro a̱tsuma̱ a ama o uvaɗi gawan a̱ tyo Urishelima u yuwaan Mogono A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva a̱ga̱nda̱ shi, oo ro'oo le shi. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18" />Agba na aza a Masar a gawan a̱ tyo Urishelima adama a̱ A̱buki o Ogodo'o shi, oo ro'oo le shi. Mɓa̱la̱ n na A̱sulazuva a zuwayi nɗa n na n gawain a̱ tyo Urishelima a yuwan A̱buki o Ogodo'o shi, n te reme le. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19" />A̱yi ɗa wo o'wo oforo aza a Masar, no oforo a nɗa n na suru n gawain adama a yuwan A̱buki o Ogodo o Ucuwusan shi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20" />O urana u ndolo a ta ɗana, &lt;&lt;Akiza uba̱ta̱ wa̱ a̱ A̱sulazuva,&gt;&gt; a̱ lingi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lingi a̱yi ɗa rumu na a̱ tsu ɗe kararrawa</char></note> vi ido. Mpondo mu u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva o to o'wo tsu Mpondo ma Akiza n na n ri elime masa'a. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21" />Upondo suru a̱tsuma̱ a̱ Urishelima na̱ Yahuda o to o'wo na akiza uba̱ta̱ wa̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva, za na suru ta̱wa̱i adama u ca kuci u ta gura tara mpondo'o u su'wan le pe. Waru o urana u ndolo za va awina na atsulu aa buwa pe o u'wa wa̱ A̱sulazuva o oɓolo a̱ a̱soja a zuva shi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14" />
</usx>